  "content": "Vipassissa ca namatthu, cakkhumantassa sirīmato.Sikhissāpi ca namatthu, sabbabhūtānukampino. ॥1॥Vessabhussa ca namatthu, ñātakassa tapassino.Namatthu Kakusandhassa, Mārasenappamaddino. ॥2॥Koṇāgamanassa namatthu, brāhmaṇassa dussimato.Kassapassa namatthu, vippamuttassa sabbadhi. ॥3॥Aṅgīrasassa namatthu, Sakyaputtassa sirīmato.Yo imaṃ dhammaṃ desesi, sabbadukkhā panūdanaṃ. ॥4॥Ye cāpi nibbutā loke, yathābhūtaṃ vipassisuṃ.Te janā apisuṇṇātha, mahantaṃ vītasāradā. ॥5॥Hitaṃ devamanussānaṃ, yaṃ namassanti Gotamaṃ.Vijjācaraṇasampannaṃ, mahantaṃ vītasāradaṃ. ॥6॥Ete caññe ca sambuddhā, anekasatakoṭiyo.Sabbe Buddhā samasamā, sabbe Buddhā mahiddhikā. ॥7॥Sabbe dasabalūpetā, tejārajjheṭṭhapāgatā.Sabbe te paṭijānanti, āsabhaṃ ṭhānamuttamaṃ. ॥8॥Sīhanādaṃ nadantete, parisāsu visāradā.Brahmacakkaṃ pavattenti, loke appaṭivattiyaṃ. ॥9॥Upetā Buddhadhammehi, aṭṭhārasahi nāyakā.Battiṃsa lakkhaṇūpetā, sītānuvyañjanā dharā. ॥10॥Vyāmappabhā supabhā, sabbe te munikuñjarā.Buddhā sabbaguṇūpetā, sabbe khīṇāsavā jinā. ॥11॥Mahāpabhā mahātejā, mahāpaññā mahābalā.Mahākassapikā therā, sabbesānaṃ sukhāvahā. ॥12॥Dīpā nāthā patiṭṭhā ca, tāṇā leṇā ca pāṇinaṃ.Gati bandhu mahesāsā, saraṇā ca hitesino. ॥13॥Sadevakasassa lokassa, sabbe ete parāyaṇā.Tesāhaṃ sirasā pāde, vandāmi purisuttame. ॥14॥Vacasā manasā ceva, vandāme Tathāgataṃ.Sayane āsane ṭhāne, gamane cāpi sabbadā. ॥15॥Sadā sukhena rakkhantu, Buddhā santikarā mama.Tepi maṃ rakkhito santo, mutto sabbabhayehi ca. ॥16॥Sabarogā vinimmutto, sabbasantāpavajjito.Sabbaverasamativakanto, nibbuto ca mamaṃ bhava. ॥17॥Tesaṃ saccena sīlena, khanti mettā balena ca.Tepi maṃ anurakkhantu, ārogyena sukhena ca. ॥18॥Purathimasmiṃ disābhāge, santi bhūtā mahiddhikā.Tepi maṃ anurakkhantu, ārogyena sukhena ca. ॥19॥Dakkhiṇasmiṃ disābhāge, santi devā mahiddhikā.Tepi maṃ anurakkhantu, ārogyena sukhena ca. ॥20॥Pacchimasmiṃ disābhāge, santi nāgā mahiddhikā.Tepi maṃ anurakkhantu, ārogyena sukhena ca. ॥21॥Uttarāsmiṃ disābhāge, santi yakkhā mahiddhikā.Tepi maṃ anurakkhantu, ārogyena sukhena ca. ॥22॥Purathimena Dhataraṭṭho, dakkhiṇena Virūḷhako.Pacchimena Virūpakkho, Kuvero uttaraṃ disaṃ. ॥23॥Cattāro te mahārājā, lokapālā yasassino.Tepi maṃ anurakkhantu, ārogyena sukhena ca. ॥24॥Ākāsaṭṭhā ca bhummaṭṭhā, devā nāgā mahiddhikā.Tepi maṃ anurakkhantu, ārogyena sukhena ca. ॥25॥Iddhimanto ca ye devā, vasantā idha sāsane.Tepi maṃ anurakkhantu, ārogyena sukhena ca. ॥26॥Sabbītiyo vivajjantu, soko rogo vinassatu.Mā te bhavatvarāyo, sukhī dīghāyuko bhava. ॥27॥Abhivādanasīlissa, niccaṃ vaddhāpacāyino.Cattāro dhammā vaḍḍhanti, āyu vaṇṇo sukhaṃ balaṃti. ॥28॥",
